                        ),
                    ],
                ),
                (
                    names: [
                        "--travel-mode",
                    ],
                    description: Some("Specifies the mode of transport when calculating a route. Used in estimating the speed of travel and road compatibility. The TravelMode you specify also determines how you specify route preferences:    If traveling by Car use the CarModeOptions parameter.   If traveling by Truck use the TruckModeOptions parameter.     Bicycle or Motorcycle are only valid when using Grab as a data provider, and only within Southeast Asia.  Truck is not available for Grab. For more information about using Grab as a data provider, see GrabMaps in the Amazon Location Service Developer Guide.  Default Value: Car"),
                    takes_value: true,
