            description: Some("Evaluates device positions against geofence geometries from a given geofence collection. The event forecasts three states for which a device can be in relative to a geofence:  ENTER: If a device is outside of a geofence, but would breach the fence if the device is moving at its current speed within time horizon window.  EXIT: If a device is inside of a geofence, but would breach the fence if the device is moving at its current speed within time horizon window.  IDLE: If a device is inside of a geofence, and the device is not moving"),
